### CLIENTS API TESTS

### 1. Create Client
POST {{baseUrl}}/clients
Content-Type: application/json
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "nome": "Cliente Teste API",
  "email": "cliente@teste.com",
  "telefone": "(11) 99999-9999",
  "endereco": "Rua Teste, 123",
  "cidade": "São Paulo",
  "estado": "SP",
  "cep": "01234-567"
}

###

### 2. List Clients
GET {{baseUrl}}/clients?page=1&limit=10
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 3. Get Client by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/clients/1
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 4. Update Client
PUT {{baseUrl}}/clients/1
Content-Type: application/json
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "nome": "Cliente Atualizado API",
  "telefone": "(11) 88888-8888"
}

###

### 5. Delete Client (Soft Delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/clients/1
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### ORDERS API TESTS

### 6. Create Order
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "clienteNome": "Cliente Pedido API",
  "formaPagamento": "dinheiro",
  "entradaValor": 100.00,
  "itens": [
    {
      "produtoId": 1,
      "quantidade": 2,
      "valorUnitario": 50.00,
      "total": 100.00,
      "descricao": "Produto Teste 1"
    },
    {
      "produtoId": 2,
      "quantidade": 1,
      "valorUnitario": 75.00,
      "total": 75.00,
      "descricao": "Produto Teste 2"
    }
  ]
}

###

### 7. List Orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?page=1&limit=10&status=pendente
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 8. Get Order by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/1
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 9. Update Order Status
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "status": "confirmado",
  "motivo": "Confirmação do pedido"
}

###

### 10. Cancel Order
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "motivo": "Cancelamento por teste"
}

###

### PAYMENTS API TESTS

### 11. Create Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "tipo": "receita",
  "valor": 175.00,
  "pedidoId": 1,
  "formaPagamento": "dinheiro",
  "descricao": "Pagamento do pedido #1",
  "dataVencimento": "2024-12-31"
}

###

### 12. List Payments
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments?page=1&limit=10&tipo=receita
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 13. Get Payment by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/1
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 14. Cancel Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/1/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "motivo": "Cancelamento por teste"
}

###

### 15. Reconcile Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/1/reconcile
Content-Type: application/json
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "valorConciliado": 175.00,
  "dataConciliacao": "2024-12-30",
  "observacoes": "Pagamento conciliado com sucesso"
}

